  "word_count": 591,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Robotic Surgery\n\n\n\n# Robotic Surgery - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## Welcome to 21st Century Dentistry!\n\n\n\n## Discover the Difference Advanced Technology Can Make\n\n\nIn the field of dentistry, it’s critical to stay on top of the latest advancements. This is especially true when placing dental implants and performing oral surgery. West LA Implants is proud to offer a variety of options in robot-assisted oral surgery in Los Angeles, CA, including dental implant surgery.\n\n\n## Yomi® Dental Implant Robot\n\n\nThe Yomi robot is one of the newest additions to the West LA Implants toolkit. This robot allows Dr. Barriere to precisely place full-mouth dental implants without the need for a surgical guide. In some cases, he can even perform surgery in less than three hours, thanks to the speed and efficiency the Yomi robot grants him.\n\nThis robot reduces the risks that come with dental implant surgery. Because it reads your cone-beam computed tomography (CBCT) scans directly, it can guide Dr. Barriere to the strongest parts of your jawbone. This protects your nerves and your sinuses.\n\nYomi is not a replacement for Dr. Barriere’s expertise. Rather, it enhances his skills, allowing him to focus on your implants.\n\nDr. Barriere Talks About Eliminate The Risk Of Human Error With 3D Guided Dental Implant Surgery\n\nDr. Barriere Talks About State-Of-The-Art Dental Technologies For Precise Results\n\n\n## NDX® nSequence\n\n\nThe NDX nSequence guided implant surgery kit allows Dr. Barriere to combine CBCT scans and CAD/CAM technology to plan your dental implant surgery. This enables you to walk away from your implant surgery with a temporary set of nanoceramic replacement teeth! It also reduces the length of your surgery, allowing you to get on with your life sooner.\n\nOur surgical guides are made from 3D printed chrome. This means that your guide is fully customized to your mouth, and we can guarantee a perfect fit.\n\n\n## Experience robot-assisted dental implant surgery.\n\n\nTour our office to find out what West LA Implants technology can do for you.\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
